{"4170540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Picasho", "steam_appid": 4170540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170540/extras/45a2b087d4e3aeb5d7c868f01f08064c.poster.avif?t=1787032805\" width=300 height=75 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170540/extras/45a2b087d4e3aeb5d7c868f01f08064c.webm?t=1787032805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become a rich and famous artist with your friends!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create art from a first-person perspective, from simple sketches to breathtaking masterpieces. Play solo or with up to three friends!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Paint masterpieces together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170540/extras/c284bdfaf32caa5a4523adb325cccb6c.poster.avif?t=1787032805\" width=700 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170540/extras/c284bdfaf32caa5a4523adb325cccb6c.webm?t=1787032805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170540/extras/c284bdfaf32caa5a4523adb325cccb6c.mp4?t=1787032805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paint</strong> on a wide range of objects using an equally wide variety of tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The painting system feels <strong>similar to real life</strong>, but without the downsides</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colors <strong>mix</strong> just the way you expect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint not only on <strong>canvases</strong>, but also on <strong>statues</strong>, <strong>furniture</strong>, <strong>busts</strong>, and much more...</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand your toolkit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170540/extras/4dca344106199e1dda12f0e1931beb79.poster.avif?t=1787032805\" width=700 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170540/extras/4dca344106199e1dda12f0e1931beb79.webm?t=1787032805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170540/extras/4dca344106199e1dda12f0e1931beb79.mp4?t=1787032805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>toolkit</strong> can be upgraded from basic brushes all the way to… a minigun?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint with lots of different <strong>textures</strong> and painting <strong>mechanics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out lots of different things that are <strong>only possible in a video game</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete commissions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170540/extras/ed354279626fe8187354087e4f0214a3.poster.avif?t=1787032805\" width=700 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170540/extras/ed354279626fe8187354087e4f0214a3.webm?t=1787032805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170540/extras/ed354279626fe8187354087e4f0214a3.mp4?t=1787032805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the most <strong>absurd commissions</strong> for the inhabitants of Inkford</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn <strong>reputation</strong> and unlock all kinds of <strong>rewards</strong>, including new tools, stencils, picture frames, and new rooms</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open your own art gallery and become FAMOUS!!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170540/extras/6ec3397f276743a69824c2980e690aeb.poster.avif?t=1787032805\" width=700 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170540/extras/6ec3397f276743a69824c2980e690aeb.webm?t=1787032805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170540/extras/6ec3397f276743a69824c2980e690aeb.mp4?t=1787032805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exhibit</strong> all of your creations in your very own gallery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open your gallery</strong> to the inhabitants of Inkford</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock more and more <strong>crazy spaces</strong> to showcase your art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you <strong>become the next breakout artist</strong> in just one week by impressing every visitor and critic?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play with friends in co-op multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170540/extras/7dd78747b8a24ee61dc4c620b819bafb.poster.avif?t=1787032805\" width=700 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170540/extras/7dd78747b8a24ee61dc4c620b819bafb.webm?t=1787032805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170540/extras/7dd78747b8a24ee61dc4c620b819bafb.mp4?t=1787032805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A famous artist needs skilled apprentices. Create art in <strong>co-op multiplayer</strong> for even more fun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite up to three <strong>friends</strong> via Steam to paint together, or build a gallery on your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create art <strong>together or compete</strong> to see who is the best artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Don't get annoyed if someone paints over your art, that's perfectly normal)</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Paint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More to come... <i>(maybe even VR support </i>👀<i>)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is a solo project, so I would be incredibly happy if you could support the development by wishlisting and following here on Steam! &lt;3</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170540/extras/45a2b087d4e3aeb5d7c868f01f08064c.poster.avif?t=1787032805\" width=300 height=75 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170540/extras/45a2b087d4e3aeb5d7c868f01f08064c.webm?t=1787032805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class